# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# start.sh and test/smoke.sh are run by /bin/sh, and a CRLF shebang makes Linux
# report "bad interpreter: No such file or directory" — naming the shell, not
# the line ending. Same rule and same reason as ../gitloom.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The runtime binaries. bin/xnet has no extension, so name the directory.
*.exe  binary
bin/*  binary
